		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Undead frost wight spawned from one of Baba Yaga's kin.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 52, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 staff +5 (2d6) or 2 spell +7, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Cold Aura</strong>. Creatures in close take 1d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Deathcall (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 13. Damage dice rolls against one near target have ADV for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Icegrasp (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 12. Target is frozen and immobilized for 1d4 rounds. Wall of Ice (CHA Spell). DC 14. 1/day, 20-foot tall, 5-foot thick wall of ice, double near length. Lasts 2d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Supreme Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
